WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.520
Representatives of every Indian tribe in the state of Wauwaka are here today to honor

00:12.520 --> 00:15.620
President Abelardo Rodriguez and his wife.

00:15.620 --> 00:21.960
The fate is known as Welawetza, an old Indian word meaning gifts and presents, and it signifies

00:21.960 --> 00:25.960
the president has the undying homage of the Wauwakans.

00:25.960 --> 00:30.120
After tribal beauties have laid gifts before the honored guests, ancient ritual dances

00:30.120 --> 00:32.600
are performed by the various groups.

00:32.600 --> 00:38.120
These Quilapam dances from the valley of Wauwaka are going through a ritual that was old even

00:38.120 --> 00:57.000
before the Spaniards came.

